@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Registrar Documento de Conocimiento Institucional (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge-documents
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "institutionId": "INSTITUTION_UUID_HERE",
  "title": "Reglamento General de Exámenes UNAM",
  "version": "2024-1",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.dgae.unam.mx/normatividad/reglamento_examenes.pdf"
}

### Listar Documentos de Conocimiento (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge-documents
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Actualizar Estado de Documento (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/knowledge-documents/DOC_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INDEXED",
  "chunkCount": 142
}

